{"title":"Ogre Firespeaker","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 51 Ogre that attacks with crush (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>112</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>121</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>87</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>95</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>112</td><td